      "id": "2063839004420919701",
      "title": "Honda is back! Their new dexterous robotic hand looks incredibly promising. It can easily lift a 5 kg load with a single finger, yet still perform highly dexter",
      "body": "Honda is back! Their new dexterous robotic hand looks incredibly promising. It can easily lift a 5 kg load with a single finger, yet still perform highly dexterous tasks such as driving an M2 screw with two fingers. Achieving this combination of strength and precision in a single hand is extremely impressive (Honda should advertise this more \ud83d\ude0a) https://t.co/Nhd1yFumwW",
