      "id": "2053111410045980718",
      "title": "These are all great points! It\u2019s now well known that image-based policies generalize very poorly to camera pose changes. Even small wrist camera angle shifts ca",
      "body": "These are all great points! It\u2019s now well known that image-based policies generalize very poorly to camera pose changes. Even small wrist camera angle shifts can completely break a learned policy. We need to move beyond flashy demos and build rigorous evaluation pipelines to systematically measure these distribution shifts \ud83d\ude09",
      "url": "https://x.com/s1wase/status/2053111410045980718",
